<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Company sign-in · StockChief</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/design.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/commercial.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>"></head><body class="commercial-auth"><main class="auth-split"><section class="auth-form"><a class="pub-brand" href="/"><span class="pub-brand__mark">◇</span><span>StockChief</span></a><div class="auth-form__body"><h1>Sign in with your company.</h1><p>Use the company code provided by your business owner. Link your identity once in StockChief Settings before your first company sign-in.</p><% for(const m of flash||[]){ %><p role="alert"><%= m.message %></p><% } %><form method="post" action="/auth/company/start" data-loading><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label class="auth-field"><span>Company sign-in code</span><input name="company" value="<%= configurationId %>" maxlength="100" required autocomplete="organization" autofocus></label><button class="pub-btn pub-btn--block" type="submit">Continue to company sign-in</button></form><p><a href="/login">Use email and password</a></p></div></section><aside class="auth-visual"><div class="auth-visual__card"><h2>Your company identity.<br>Your StockChief operation.</h2><p>Your identity provider handles sign-in. StockChief keeps your existing business permissions.</p></div></aside></main></body></html>
